  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, combine the canned kidney beans, diced tomatoes, onion, garlic, caraway seeds, dried oregano, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Mix well to combine.",
    "Transfer the bean mixture to a 9x9-inch baking dish.",
    "Drizzle the olive oil over the top and sprinkle with bread crumbs.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes, or until the top is golden brown and the beans are hot and bubbly.",
    "Let the dish rest for a few minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
